# What the image build never needs. The Dockerfile copies only package
# manifests, tsconfig.base.json, shared/ and server/ (and web/package.json),
# and content/cards.json.
#
# Compiled output and build state are left out so the build always compiles
# from source: a stale tsconfig.tsbuildinfo would let `tsc -b` skip emitting.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Secrets and the local database
.env
.env.*
infrastructure/.env
data

# The card list's pictures are the page's; only the list itself goes in.
content/**
!content/cards.json

# Not part of the image
.git
.claude
corpus
design
docs
scripts
vendor
web/src
web/scripts
web/index.html
